# How to cite lab-harness. GitHub reads this file for the repository's
# "Cite this repository" button, which offers it as APA and BibTeX.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use lab-harness in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "lab-harness: a minimal agent harness in Python, built for research"
abstract: >-
  An agent harness in python small enough to read in an afternoon: one agentic loop
  across vendors, every step a typed event, and every request reproducible
  from its transcript.
authors:
  - given-names: Liyan
    family-names: Xu
repository-code: https://github.com/lxucs/lab-harness
license: MIT
keywords:
  - agents
  - llm
  - agent harness
  - research
  - reproducibility
